{"id":"45a40cdcc24cf331","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer.md","title":"封闭System T数项的规范数值","display":"df-system-t-numerical-normalizer — 封闭System T数项的规范数值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer","aliases":["72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer"],"display":"df-system-t-numerical-normalizer — 封闭System T数项的规范数值","depends_on":["[[72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction]]","[[72-thm-system-t-normalization]]","[[72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity]]"],"chapter":"V","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V §§4.2–4.3, print358–360/PDF370–372; local unique-description construction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-system-t-numerical-normalizer — 封闭System T数项的规范数值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a273d157ddbe764d\" href=\"?note=a273d157ddbe764d\" title=\"72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction\">72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d1bdc5d626d71488\" href=\"?note=d1bdc5d626d71488\" title=\"72-thm-system-t-normalization\">72-thm-system-t-normalization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"852e36a39d13964a\" href=\"?note=852e36a39d13964a\" title=\"72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity\">72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"V"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V §§4.2–4.3, print358–360/PDF370–372; local unique-description construction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0}^c\">\\(t\\in\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0}^c\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TNF}\">\\(\\operatorname{TNF}\\)</span>、数码及其唯一性沿用所引两条定理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{num}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{num}_T\\)</span> 只在封闭数类型项上定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{num}_T(t):=\\iota n\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{TNF}_{\\mathsf0}(t,\\overline n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{num}_T(t):=\\iota n\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{TNF}_{\\mathsf0}(t,\\overline n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{num}_T:\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0}^c\\to\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{num}_T:\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0}^c\\to\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正规化给正规形，归约保持类型和封闭性，规范形定理使其为数码；合流及数码唯一性使 ι 单值。该定义依赖一般正规化来源的证据限制；没有把总数值函数的存在误称为对象 T₀ 内部统一证明其终止。</p>\n<p>本轮深审：类型与封闭性保持现在由书内专门引理逐根步给出；正规化、合流、规范形与类型保持分别承担存在性、唯一性、数码形状及输入输出类型的义务。</p>\n","hea